  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Protection and cash assistance support to vulnerable households in Palestine.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address both economic and social vulnerabilities of children and their families based on the foundation of children with protection concerns. The aim is to provide a lifeline for vulnerable families with children through regular and predictable cash transfers to meet basic needs; offer referrals and linkages with information, knowledge and services on health and nutrition, and child protection; and strengthen the national social protection system with a focus on making it more shock-responsive and inclusive through capacity building and systems strengthening.</narrative>
  </description>
